      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P8",
      "claim": "Mild contamination, 2-5% drift; better on related questions, worse on unrelated",
      "outcome": "Mean probability drift (total variation between the batched and individual answer distributions, which for a noul is the absolute difference of the two probabilities) was 0.0046; the discrete answer changed on 0.002 of questions. Related questions: accuracy -0.001 batched (drift 0.0075, McNemar p=1). Unrelated questions: accuracy +0.000 batched (drift 0.0026, McNemar p=1). Drift is outside the predicted 2-5% band but inside the 10% falsification bar. The predicted direction split did not hold.",
